<title>SOUTH KOREA: Lotte Chilsung '96 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Lotte Chilsung '96 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			  249     vs	    452</p>
<p>    Net (in million won)	   308     vs	    559</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net			 1.09   vs	   1.87</p>
<p>    Turnover			   631.6   vs	 605.5</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, in cash, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>					     5.0   vs	    8.2</p>
<p>Note - Lotte Chilsung Beverage Co Ltd, an affiliate of the Lotte Group, said its 1996 share capital was unchanged at 1.24 million common shares and 120,000 preferred shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
